# Customize Your 2-Module Frame Setup

Well done! You've selected a 2-module configuration for this frame, dividing the 0.5m x 0.5m x 0.5m unit into two equal sections for added variety and flexibility—perfect for mixing produce types (e.g., herbs in one and small fish in the other) with tailored AI optimization for each. Now, select a product category for the first module, then one for the second—we'll fine-tune the settings like lighting, irrigation, and nutrients accordingly to maximize your balcony's potential.

### Select Category for Module 1
Pick **one** category to dedicate the first module to:

- [ ] Herbs (Compact, fast-growing for fresh flavors)  
- [ ] Leafy Greens (Broad-leafed for salads and cooking)  
- [ ] Fruiting Veg (Plants producing edible fruits or pods)  
- [ ] Roots & Stems (Nutrient-storing underground or above-ground parts)  
- [ ] Edible Flowers & Specialty Greens (Flowering or unique leafy varieties)  
- [ ] Aquatic Plants & Algae (Water-based for integrated systems)  
- [ ] Mushrooms and Edible Fungi (Fungal for earthy flavors)  
- [ ] Snails (Terrestrial for gourmet proteins)  
- [ ] Small Fish (Aquatic for light proteins)  
- [ ] Molluscs (Shelled for steamed meals)  
- [ ] Crustaceans (Dwarf for quick seafood)  
- [ ] Other Compact Fauna (Varied small animals)  

### Select Category for Module 2
Pick **one** category to dedicate the second module to (you can choose the same as Module 1 or mix it up for diversity):

- [ ] Herbs (Compact, fast-growing for fresh flavors)  
- [ ] Leafy Greens (Broad-leafed for salads and cooking)  
- [ ] Fruiting Veg (Plants producing edible fruits or pods)  
- [ ] Roots & Stems (Nutrient-storing underground or above-ground parts)  
- [ ] Edible Flowers & Specialty Greens (Flowering or unique leafy varieties)  
- [ ] Aquatic Plants & Algae (Water-based for integrated systems)  
